source/reference_guide/fsi.rst:44: (Nastran) ["Astrakhan", "Strand", "Rastaban"] The modal model reduces the structural response to a small set of Nastran mode shapes, integrates the modal equations of motion (via a Newmark-beta scheme) forced by the aerodynamic pressure load, and maps the resulting modal deformation back onto the fluid surface and, via RBF or IDW, into the volume mesh.
